The '''Catfish''' is a {{Rarity|r|nolink=y}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be caught from fishing in [[Water]] after reaching {{skl|fishing|XIII}}.

== Spawning ==
A '''Catfish''' can be fished up from any water source with a Water [[Fishing Rods|Fishing Rod]] and {{Skill|fishing|XIII}}. 

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for the '''Catfish''' is {{Green|250}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|5.82%|1|17.18|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Certain modifiers can be used to increase it:
